am.org/bot${TG_BOT_TOKEN}/sendMessage\" \\\n  -d chat_id=\"$CHAT_ID\" --data-urlencode text=\"$1\"); then\n  echo \"notify.sh: telegram send failed: $resp\" >&2\n  exit 1\nfi\n"}}}
